      "created_at": "2026-04-04T05:10:11.540Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Please refer to a similar post from the previous term for this - <a href=\"https://discourse.onlinedegree.iitm.ac.in/t/request-for-postponement-of-oppe-scheduled-on-6th-december-2025/192726/2\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Request for Postponement of OPPE Scheduled on 6th December 2025 - #2</a></p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-ds-students\" data-username=\"22f3000671\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"192726\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://dub1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/user_avatar/discourse.onlinedegree.iitm.ac.in/22f3000671/48/148470_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"><a href=\"/t/192726/2\">On another topic</a></div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Please inform the support team at <code>support@study.iitm.ac.in</code> immediately, and include all the necessary supporting documents.</p>\n<p>You will need to convince them of the genuineness of your request.</p>\n<p>As a side note, the second OPPE is designed to help students pass the course. While passing will be relatively easy, scoring high marks will be more challenging compared to OPPE 1. This structure ensures that students do not use the additional time as an opportunity for extended preparation.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>",
